1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Annika married Andreas Bergdahl 1716-12-30 at her father Ingmar Björk's home. Annika's father Captain Björk died in war in Poland with Skaraborgs Regemente. She is granddaughter of ancestors Johannes Lechander and 
2 CONC Anna Hornius.
2 CONT
2 CONT Anders Bergdahl and Annika Björk were named as parents in their daughter Christina Bergdahl's baptism.
2 CONT
2 CONT Her 1754 estate inventory names husband: Anders Bergdahl and children Ingemar, Magdalena Britta Lena, Annika Stina, Christina, and Maja. She had $548.26 in assets which took 5 pages to inventory.
2 CONT
