2 CONT 💞 Constance Maria Hisinger is [https://www.geni.com/path/Eric-af-Kumo+is+related+to+Constance-Maria-Hisinger?from=6000000019395507263&path_type=inlaw&to=5544497530870036593 '''Eric Larsson af Kumo's'''] 12th great grandson's wife.
