1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Hakvin (Håkon) Benedicti''' married Beata JÖNSDOTTER (1574-1644).  Her father was Johan ULFONIS (- 1594): her mother was  Ingegerd OLOFSDOTTER (- 1612).  She was born about 1574 Södra Ving, Älvsborg.  She died 1
2 CONC 644 Södra Ving, Älvsborg. Hakvin died in 1636 at the age of 84 in Södra Wing, Älvsborg län (Västergötland), Sweden. Hakvin (Håkan) BENGTSSON BENEDICTI became a parson in Ving parish 1596.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources 
2 CONT * 1)  http://www.schanberg.com/genealogi/html1/default.html 
2 CONT * 2)  04906 Disbyt 
2 CONT * 3)   Skara Stifts Herdaminne, sid 480;  Disbyt 29292;  04906 Disbyt;  www.genvagar.nu
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Wingeflycht_nr_1393
2 CONT
2 CONT -------------------------
2 CONT Biography (from "Skara stifts herdaminne"): Wing, Åhs Härad parish: "Haqvin. Benedicti became pastor in 1596 and died in 1636. Married to the predecessor's [Joh. Ulfonis'] daughter Beata Jönsdotter, died in 1644. From them descend
2 CONC s the Winge family. Children: Bengt, drowned in Wingsjön. Elias succeeded his father. Kerstin, older than dean Arv. Hornius in Fristad. Estrid, older than dean L. Lechander in Skara. Anna, older than dean Er. Scarinius in Dala. Sa
2 CONC ra, older than vicar N. Lechander in Lekåsa. Beata, older than vicar Amb. Joh. in Skölfvened."
2 CONT -- Johan Wilhelm Warholm, "Skara stifts herdaminne" (1874), p. 480, https://runeberg.org/skarahe2/0485.html and https://runeberg.org/skarahe2/0486.html
