2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ERROR: Bengta was married not to her father-in-law https://www.geni.com/people/Haqvinus-Arvidi/6000000007026060200, but to his son Arvid Haquini Hornius, https://www.geni.com/people/Arvid-Hornius/6000000001503509259
