2 CONT '''Gustaf af Bjerkén'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * Student, Uppsala
2 CONT * 1748 [http://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Auskultant Auskultant], [http://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bergskollegium Bergskollegium] [Swedish Board of Mines]
2 CONT * 1754 Volontär & Under-Konduktör, [http://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fortifikationen Fortifikationen]
2 CONT * 1757 Adjutant, [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/V%C3%A4sterbottens_regemente Westerbotten Regiment]
2 CONT * 1758 Fänrik, Westerbotten Regiment
2 CONT * oo 1767-01-23 in [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tuulos Tuulos] with Eva Margaretha de Carnall
2 CONT * 1770 Captain, Westerbotten Regiment
2 CONT * 1771 Captain, [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Upplands_regemente_%28infantry%29 Uppland Regiment]
2 CONT * 1772 Riddare af Svärds-Orden, [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Order_of_the_Sword Royal Order of the Sword]
2 CONT * 1773-02-04 Nobil. & Adopt. ''af Bjerkén'', introd. No. 1995
2 CONT * 1776 Afsked
2 CONT * † 1799-06-18 Kauppilanmäki, Leppävirta, Finland, at Fältkammererare Hasselblatt
