1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Blythe KarstadtI am of Swedish descent 2 h  ·  Today, February 5, is the 150th anniversary of the artist Birger Sandzén.  Born in Sweden, he came to central Kansas to teach at Bethany College in Lindsborg KS.  He s
2 CONC tayed there the rest of his life, and left behind a rich legacy of art and an appreciation for the cultural arts.  He is  one of the many contributors to why my hometown Lindsborg is such a special place.  He met his wife, Alfrida
2 CONC , in Kansas, and their daughter Margaret, together with her husband Pelham Greenough III, created a museum in Sandzén's honor after his death.  The museum is hosting a major exhibition of Sandzén's works in honor of this 150th ann
2 CONC iversary, as well as publishing a new catalog. From Facebook 20210205
