1 NOTE {geni:about_me} The Schulman Family Association, founded in 1938, has as its main goal to promote cohesion among family members, but also to support genealogical research and manage the family register and archives. 
2 CONT
2 CONT In the summer of 2020, the family association's board transferred the family chronicle to an e-book. This makes this limited edition book available to the entire family and also for general use in a genealogical context.
