2 CONT * Fru:	Fredrika Regina Westring (född Rahm)
2 CONT * Barn:	Carolina Fredrika Westring, Carl Ambrosius Westring, Marie Louise Westring, Anna Constantia Ulrica Westring
2 CONT * Syskon:	Maria Helena Westring, Ambrosius Westring, Carin Maria Westring
