2 CONT Ärkebiskop (nr. 46).
2 CONT
2 CONT Archbishop Eric Benzelus "the younger" In the early 1700's, Eric "the younger' was the Librarian at the University of Uppsala.  He is described as a brilliant, modern, forward-looking man who thought that science held the key to t
2 CONC he future. He mkodernized the Library and in doing so corresponded with many prominent men of learning in Europe.  Eric was eventually named Bishop of Linkoping, Sweden. H died not long after being appointed Archbishop of Uppsala 
2 CONC in 1742.
2 CONT
2 CONT Död https://sok.riksarkivet.se/bildvisning/C0016905_00168#?c=&m=&s=&cv=167&xywh=3402%2C1167%2C1564%2C922
2 CONT
2 CONT Biografi https://sok.riksarkivet.se/sbl/mobil/Artikel/18503
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Eric Benzelius, d.y.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * Född:	27 Januari 1675 Uppsala, Uppsala län, Sweden 
2 CONT * Död:	23 September 1743 (68) Linköping, Sweden 
2 CONT * Begravningsort:	Linköpings domkyrka, Linköping, Sweden 
2 CONT
2 CONT * Son till Eric Benzelius, d.ä. och Margareta Odhelia 
2 CONT * Make till Anna Swedenborg 
2 CONT * Fader till Erik Benzelstierna; Margareta Benzelia Benzelstierna; Carl Jesper Benzelius; Albrekt Benzelstierna; Adolph Benzelstierna; och Ulrika Benzelstierna 
2 CONT * Bror till Christina Benzelia; Olof Benzelstierna; Lars Benzelstierna; Jakob Benzelius; Nils Benzelstierna; Gustaf Benzelstierna; Henrik Benzelius och Margareta Benzelia 
2 CONT ----
