1 NAME Henrik /Benzelius/
2 GIVN Henrik
2 _MARNM Benzelius
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 7 AUG 1689
2 PLAC Strängnäs
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE 20 MAY 1758
